This project has a graphify knowledge graph at reports/graphify-out/.

- Before answering architecture or codebase questions, read reports/graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md for god nodes and community structure
- If reports/graphify-out/wiki/index.md exists, navigate it instead of reading raw files
- After modifying code files in this session, run `graphify update .` to keep the graph current (AST-only, no API cost)

Git: `reports/graphify-out/cache/`, `graph.json`, and `graph.html` are listed in `.gitignore` (regenerate locally). You may commit `GRAPH_REPORT.md` and optional `wiki/` for shared context; avoid committing cache or huge graph dumps.
